cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WARRANT, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "WARRANT: a Lean 4 kernel whose only currency is provenance-indexed evidence"
abstract: >-
  WARRANT checks lean4export files of Lean 4 declarations. Every fact the checker uses (a term is well-scoped, a term
  has a type, two terms are convertible, a type is a proposition, an inductive declaration is admissible) is an
  evidence value minted by exactly one function and stamped with the environment, universe substitution and context it
  holds in; metadata in the file is parsed as a claim and becomes a fact only by re-derivation.
authors:
  - name: "WARRANT contributors"
  - family-names: "Bashir"
    given-names: "Mikael"
repository-code: "https://github.com/competemath/warrant"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - proof checker
  - type theory
  - OCaml
